  "One frozen local release binary, synthetic generated zero-byte metadata, no cloud credentials, content reads or foreground provider requests.",
  "TMPDIR and SQLITE_TMPDIR were placed explicitly on Btrfs and verified in the live environment. No concurrent local compilation or other benchmarks ran.",
  "first_entry seconds measure only OPENDIR to the first returned entry of the giant directory. Traversal seconds measure a whole pass, including the complete enumeration and deferred release.",
